  "body": "## Summary\nThis Pull Request implements and hardens Major Phase F1 (Work Packages P00–P02: Baseline, Specification, and Test Isolation Harness) for Lab 3, addressing all peer review findings on branch `feature/f1-prep-and-test-harness` (Resolves #36).\n\n## Key Deliverables & Hardening Pass\n1. **Database & Environment Guards (LCP-01, HARNESS-01):**\n   - Implemented fail-closed test environment guards in `server/src/config/testEnvironment.ts` and `server/scripts/run-tests.mjs` requiring `DATABASE_URL_TEST` targeting `toktickit_test` or `toktickit_test_<suffix>`. Refuses execution against ambient/dev database.\n   - Enforced strict attachment directory isolation (`assertContained`) within `server/test-uploads/<runId>` to eliminate path traversal risks.\n   - Port rejection (`validateApiEndpoint` / `resolveApiBase`): Prohibits development port 3000 during test execution; requires port 3001.\n2. **Playwright Worker & WebServer Hardening (`playwright.config.ts`):**\n   - Synchronized test mode, run ID, screenshot directory, and API URL to workers.\n   - Configured exact path matching (`isProbeFile`) for `e2e/lab-03/worker-env.spec.ts` without regex loopholes or suffix ambiguity. Full test suites and non-probe files with `PLAYWRIGHT_SKIP_WEBSERVER=true` fail closed immediately.\n   - Zero environment state leakage (`PLAYWRIGHT_IS_PROBE` removed).\n3. **Shared Containment Cleanup & Failure Simulation:**\n   - Single source of truth helper `cleanupAttachmentFiles` used by both E2E `test.afterAll` and integration tests.\n   - Simulated physical unlink error (`EPERM`) verifying cleanup failures fail test runs visibly per HARNESS-01.\n4. **Lab 3 Five-Major-Phase Architecture:**\n   - Aligned `docs/lab-03/PHASES.md`, `AGENTS.md`, and `.antigravityrules` with Major Phases F1–F5 while preserving P00–P14 work-package IDs.\n   - Added documentation: `docs/lab-03/whatihavedone1.md`, `docs/lab-03/ai1.md`, `docs/lab-03/aiused1.md`, and updated `docs/lab-03/implementation-log.md`.\n\n## Verification Results\n- **HARNESS-01 Suite (`tests/lab-03/test-environment.test.ts`):** 24/24 passed (zero skips).\n- **Client Test Suite (`npm run test:client`):** 37/37 passed across 8 suites.\n- **Server & Client TypeScript Builds:** 0 errors.\n- **Whitespace / Diff Integrity (`git diff --check`):** Clean.\n- **Status Gate:** Maintained as `In progress — P02 review fixes applied` pending disposable PostgreSQL DB verification for full DB suites.\n\nCloses #36",
